  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_0599.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Un animado pasacalle de disfraces ha recorrido las calles del Arrabal del Castillo, en Onda, la noche de este domingo. A mediod&iacute;a del lunes, vuelo de cometas y paellas para continuar con las fiestas del barrio.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0598.jpg\" alt=\"img_0598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0599.jpg\" alt=\"img_0599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0602.jpg\" alt=\"img_0602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0604.jpg\" alt=\"img_0604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0606.jpg\" alt=\"img_0606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0608.jpg\" alt=\"img_0608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0610.jpg\" alt=\"img_0610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescatxirulospaellesfestesravalcastellonda/img_0612.jpg\" al